# Tracking plan

Event names are snake_case object_action, for example signup_completed. Every event and its properties
are listed in events/registry.json, and test/registry.test.js fails on any event that isn't.

--- docs/warehouse.md ---
# From the collector to the warehouse

The warehouse loader only loads events that have a dbt model in the analytics repository, which the
data-eng team owns. When you add an event, ask data-eng for its model; until it exists the event is
collected and never reaches the warehouse.

